        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 weeks ago",
        "text": "I had a wonderful experience visiting the bangle section of this jewellery shop. The variety and craftsmanship on display were truly impressive – from elegant gold designs to intricate traditional pieces, every bangle seemed to tell a story of its own. Whether you’re looking for something timeless or more contemporary, there’s a piece for every taste and occasion.\n\nA special thanks to Mr Arpan who assisted me – He was not only knowledgeable but also incredibly patient and attentive. He took the time to understand my preferences and guided me through the options with genuine enthusiasm. His expertise and warm demeanor made the whole shopping experience feel personalized and enjoyable.\n\nI left the store with a beautiful set of bangles and a smile on my face. Highly recommend visiting this section if you’re looking for quality, variety, and top-notch customer service!",
        "time": 1749462748
      },
